// Do not replace BG2000's original area script. Append only the tiny death
// counter/reward-dialogue launcher used by Lahl's five QC Ankhegs.
EXTEND_BOTTOM ~BG2000.BCS~ ~CotSC/qc_werewolf_island/QCBG2000.baf~
